---
import Eyebrow from "./Eyebrow.astro";
---

<section class="features" aria-labelledby="features-title">
  <header class="features__header">
    <h2 id="features-title">Stay oriented while the agent works.</h2>
  </header>
  <div class="features__grid">
    <article>
      <p class="features__number">01 / Context</p>
      <h3>Context stays visible.</h3>
      <p>
        See the project instructions, skills, model, and search mode shaping the current run before you send a prompt.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="features__number">02 / Tools</p>
      <h3>Every tool call has a shape.</h3>
      <p>
        The model reads, searches, edits, and runs commands through typed tools with workspace limits and capped output.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="features__number">03 / Sessions</p>
      <h3>Sessions leave a trail.</h3>
      <p>Resume a structured transcript with tool status, token usage, and audit metadata already attached.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .features {
    width: min(var(--thndrs-content-width), calc(100% - 3rem));
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 11vw, 6rem);
  }

  .features__header {
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--thndrs-border);
  }

  .features h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--thndrs-fg);
    font-family: var(--thndrs-font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 450;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.04;
  }

  .features__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  }

  .features article {
    min-height: 21rem;
    padding: 2.625rem 2.125rem 2rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--thndrs-border);
  }

  .features article + article {
    padding-left: 2.125rem;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--thndrs-border);
  }

  .features__number {
    color: var(--thndrs-purple);
    font-family: var(--thndrs-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .features h3 {
    margin: 0 0 1.125rem;
    color: var(--thndrs-fg);
    font-family: var(--thndrs-font-serif);
    font-size: 1.55rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .features article > p:last-child {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--thndrs-fg-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  @media (max-width: 56rem) {
    .features__header,
    .features__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .features__header {
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .features article {
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 2.125rem 0 2.5rem;
    }

    .features article + article {
      padding-left: 0;
      border-left: 0;
    }

    .features__number {
      margin-bottom: 2.125rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 40rem) {
    .features {
      width: calc(100% - 1.75rem);
    }
  }
</style>
